// an absolute target's directory prefix. Those prefix links are invisible after the target is
// translated to a repository-relative name, but the kernel counts them toward the same ELOOP
// limit as the link whose target contained them. Counting only the links opened through os.Root
// would therefore authorize chains the host rejects (for example, each /tmp component on macOS
// also follows /tmp -> /private/tmp).
//
